andise/mumbai_staticmap.webp)\n\n## Similar Societies","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/fine-heights/176681/project","title":"Fine Heights, Malad West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹1.51 Cr Onwards | 2 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Fine Developments developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/fine-developments-28467-7885.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Fine Heights Malad West, Mumbai\n\n**₹1.51 Cr**\n\n₹28,950 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why Invest Through Square Yards?\n\n![Zero brokerage icon](/assets/images/zero-brokerage.svg)\n\n### Zero Brokerage\n\n100% Service, 0% Brokerage\n\n![Lowest price icon](/assets/images/lowest-price.svg)\n\n### Lowest Price Guaranteed\n\nHighly unlikely, but if you find a lower price anywhere, tell us and we will match it.\n\n![Full service support icon](/assets/images/full-service-support.svg)\n\n### Full Service Support\n\nOur sales personnel are accountable for every step.\n\n## Fine Heights Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Fine Heights.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  522 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.51 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nFine Heights's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malad West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Fine Heights | Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 28950 | 30550 |\n| Mar 2026 | 22850 | 30150 |\n| Dec 2025 | 23250 | 28850 |\n| Sep 2025 | 23400 | 27900 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nFine Heights avg. price is ₹ 28.9 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Malad West at ₹ 30.6 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Ajmera Shikhar](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ajmera-shikhar/231644/project \"Ajmera Shikhar\") | ₹ 36,100 |\n| Malad West | ₹ 30,550 |\n| [Chandak 34 Park Estate D Wing](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/chandak-34-park-estate-d-wing/102342/project \"Chandak 34 Park Estate D Wing\") | ₹ 30,500 |\n| Current Project **Fine Heights** | ₹ 28,950 |\n| [DGS Sheetal Sahyog](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/dgs-sheetal-sahyog/244469/project \"DGS Sheetal Sahyog\") | ₹ 27,550 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Malad West ranges from ₹ 19.9 K to ₹ 1.3 L with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Fine Heights | In Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 38.3 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 62.4 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 80.4 K |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 1.3 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Fine Heights.\n\nA total of 6 residential transactions has been registered so far for Fine Heights, amounting to ₹ 6 Cr till September 2026.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Fine Heights moved from ₹ 22,850/sqft to ₹ 28,950/sqft, reflecting a 26.70% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nA total of 4 out of 16 launched units have been booked as of February 2026, including 25% of 2 BHK(4 out of 16 units).\n\nExternal Works has reached 65%, Internal finishing stands at 45%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 50% done.\n\nA total of 4 out of 16 launched units have been booked as of May 2025, including 25% of 2 BHK(4 out of 16 units).\n\nA total of 2 out of 16 launched units have been booked as of February 2025, including 13% of 2 BHK(2 out of 16 units).\n\nStructural Works reach 80% completion, Internal finishing stands at 23%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 35% done.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n6 Sales Transactions Registered in Fine Heights From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 18.4 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 6 | ₹ 6 Cr | ₹ 18,450 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Fine Heights Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 522 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Fine Heights, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.51 Cr\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Fine Heights\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-kidsplay-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/sv